  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  targetText: {fileID: 1867440341}
  fullText: 'On top of all that, sometimes lithium ion batteries can cause fires
    in machines (usually the magnet sorter). If you see this warning, get to the
    magnet sorter quickly to put out the fire!


    It''s important never to put
    batteries in the general recycling--there are specific centres for recycling
    batteries. '
  charactersPerSecond: 40
